    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物，矮人</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 17，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 14</span><span>''侦查'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 5 火焰，5 毒素</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 5</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}战锤（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：8 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}地狱尖刺（毒素）✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 3（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：6 伤害，以及 2 点持续毒素伤害（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 18（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+2）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，异怪语，矮人语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 链甲，战锤</span></div></div>\n</div>",
